From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] panvk: advertise robustImageAccess2 on v11+ only biblioklept

csf-v11/181 turned robustImageAccess2 on for v10+ on the assumption that
v10 LD_TEX behaves like v11. It does not. Firebase PanProbe on G610
(manaus) and G710 (panther) fails 6 robust_image_access2 cases, all
RGBA8_UNORM storage-image loads out of bounds (x, y, layer, negative x,
x aliased at 65537, layer aliased at 65536): they return (0,0,0,1)
instead of (0,0,0,0). R32_UINT (where (0,0,0,1) is the right answer),
texelFetch (TEX_FETCH) and texel buffers pass. G615 (v11) passes all.

v10 has no native control for this:
- The Texture descriptor is the same on v10 and v11 (genxml), and it has
  no border/OOB field. Border color and address modes live in the
  sampler, which LD_TEX does not use.
- LD_TEX/LD_TEX_IMM are emitted the same way on every Valhall arch
  (bi_emit_load_tex_to), with no OOB modifier in the ISA.
- Swizzle cannot force A=0 out of bounds without breaking in-bounds A.
- Routing image loads through TEX_FETCH would go through the texture
  cache, which is not coherent with storage writes in the same dispatch.

The only remaining fix is a shader-side bounds check, which this series
does not do. So v10 drops back to robustImageAccess, whose
(0,0,0,0)-or-(0,0,0,1) rule the v10 hardware does meet.

DXVK only needs robustImageAccess, so it is unaffected. vkd3d-proton
requires robustImageAccess2 at device creation, so D3D12 does not work
on v10 (vkd3d is deferred anyway).

Purpose: stop advertising robustImageAccess2 on v10 (LD_TEX OOB returns alpha 1)
Upstream-commit: none (upstream main still reports robustImageAccess2 = false)
Tested GPU: Mali-G610 MC3 (motorola edge 40 neo, v10), Mali-G710 MC7 (Pixel 7, v10), Firebase Test Lab
Tested Kbase UAPI: CSF 1.18 (MediaTek) and CSF 1.14 (Pixel)
Mesa base range: 5a07217f034b (26.3.0-devel), patched through csf-v11/181
Validation test: PanProbe robust_image_access2 (SKIP on v10, PASS on v11)
Dependencies: csf-v11/181
Generated-by: LLM
---

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index 5066aff9..ba1334b2 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -649,7 +649,7 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_features)(

       /* VK_KHR_robustness2 */
       .robustBufferAccess2 = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
-      .robustImageAccess2 = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
+      .robustImageAccess2 = PAN_ARCH >= 11,
       .nullDescriptor = PAN_ARCH >= 10,

       /* VK_EXT_shader_tile_image */
